{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Draw near to the altar.</b> For Aaron was ashamed and afraid to approach. Moses said to him: Why are you ashamed? For this you were chosen (Sifra)." "<b>Your sin-offering.</b> A calf of the herd." "<b>And your burnt-offering.</b> The ram." "<b>The offering of the people.</b> A goat of the goats, and a calf and a lamb. Everywhere that \"עֵגֶל\" is stated, it is a yearling — and from here you learn (ibid.)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:34.325530950Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}